# FINISH — Doc Router Update

**Mandatory** before handoff. Дополняет `finish-block.mdc`: только routing `load_now`/by-command/graphify.

**Fill-in:** @.cursor/templates/finish-doc-router.md — не копировать скелет в rules.

## By command

| Command | load_now update |
|---------|-----------------|
| `* IMPLEMENT` | next substep OR epic complete → §Handoff epic complete (`* QA <plan_id>`) |
| `* QA` | `## Handoff * QA` + qa link; fail/blocked → `review.md` §Fix plan + §Epic QA |
| `* BUGFIX` | bugfix-artifact + §BUGFIX FINISH → `* QA` пока pass |
| `* REFLECT` | align post-task |
| `ARCHIVE NOW` | clear stale; «await VAN» or next T-xxx |
| `* CREATIVE` | next IMPLEMENT shard + rewire `sNN`/`eNN` (`needs_creative — closed`) |
| `INTEG PLAN/GAP/GAP CLOSE` | см. шаблон |
| `* DECOMPOSE` | first step file `s01|e01-*.md` (не index) |
| `VAN` / `TASK` / `BUGFIX` | init or shift focus |

## graphify update

После code_changed (IMPLEMENT/BUGFIX/REFACTOR/TASK): cwd=корень → `.venv/bin/graphify update .`; `--force` только если узлов меньше. Пропуск: PLAN/DECOMPOSE/VAN/QA/REFLECT/ARCHIVE.

## Forbidden at FINISH

- Completed work в `load_now`; full index в `load_now`
- `decompose=completed` / next `load_now` **до** step-файл + `## Handoff`
- IMPLEMENT done без step-файл

